WEBVTT

00:13:27.497 --> 00:13:30.963
we are an insulin-producing company.

00:13:30.997 --> 00:13:36.897
And when I look at producing insulin,
it has to be affordable

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:40.897
and accessible to a billion people
at least who need that insulin.

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:43.863
So that's what I mean
by saying that for me,

00:13:43.897 --> 00:13:47.497
a blockbuster drug is about serving
at least a billion patients,

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:49.430
not about a billion dollars,

00:13:49.463 --> 00:13:52.330
because the moment you serve
a billion patients anyway,

00:13:52.363 --> 00:13:55.530
it's going to be over a billion
dollars of an opportunity.

00:13:55.963 --> 00:13:59.730
So to me, it's about patients first
and business will follow.

00:13:59.763 --> 00:14:02.263
SR: Kiran, thank you so much
for talking to me today.